  "notes": "Two-weight wordmark: light \"PHASE\" (grey #abaaaa in source) + bold \"ONE\" (cyan #00adef in source) whose N/E gap forms a negative-space \"1\"; both flattened to one colour. Source is a self-vectorised Inkscape SVG (creator comment: Marsupilami, version 20110311; originally uploaded to de.wikipedia 2009, transferred to Commons 2015, author listed as unknown) traced from phaseone.com; Commons file sha1 540c4b53... verified unchanged. No transforms, no text, no background. Coordinates converted to absolute and rounded to 4 dp; the source viewBox's 3% border was dropped (tight bbox = artwork 428.424 x 59.1185). Pixel-overlay against the official header SVG currently served on phaseone.com: 0.01% mismatch (same artwork). Counters (P, A, O) come from path direction; renders identically with evenodd. Alternative File:Phase-one-logo-vector.svg on Commons is CC-BY-4.0 (not used)."
